WELCOME TO ZORK!

ZORK is a game of adventure, danger, and low cunning.
In it you will explore some of the most amazing territory ever seen by mortals. No computer should be without one!


Translated to Yaifl by PPK, based on the Inform 7 translation by John Escobedo.
Original by Marc Blank, Dave Lebling, Bruce Daniels, and Tim Anderson.

